        "$\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt5}$",
        "$\\dfrac12$",
        "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$",
        "$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}$"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "solution": "$\\sin^{-1}x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-\\cot^{-1}\\dfrac12=\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac12$. $\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac12$ எனும் கோணத்திற்கு $\\sin\\theta=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}$, எனவே $x=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}$."
